        <p source="#source-23254-23316"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-23254-23290"><rb>清涼殿</rb><rt>せいりやうでん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-23290-23299">の春の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-23299-23311"><rb>夜</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-23311-23316">の</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-23316-23347"><seg source="#source-23316-23347">月の光に照らされつ</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-23347-23409"><seg source="#source-23347-23353">雲を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-23353-23371"><rb>彫</rb><rt>ちりば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-23371-23374">め</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-23374-23389"><rb>濤</rb><rt>なみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-23389-23392">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-23392-23404"><rb>刻</rb><rt>ほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-23404-23409">り</seg></p>
