      <div>
        <p source="#source-63816-63866"><seg source="#source-63816-63828">をとこの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-63828-63846"><rb>氣息</rb><rt>いき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-63846-63866">のやはらかき</seg></p>
