        <p source="#source-64139-64174"><seg source="#source-64139-64174">をとこの黒き目のいろの</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-64174-64215"><seg source="#source-64174-64189">お夏の胸に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-64189-64204"><rb>映</rb><rt>うつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-64204-64215">るとき</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-64215-64274"><seg source="#source-64215-64227">をとこの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-64227-64242"><rb>紅</rb><rt>あか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-64242-64245">き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-64245-64269"><rb>口脣</rb><rt>くちびる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-64269-64274">の</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-64274-64308"><seg source="#source-64274-64308">お夏の口にもゆるとき</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-64308-64340"><seg source="#source-64308-64340">人こそしらね嗚呼戀の</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-64340-64375"><seg source="#source-64340-64375">ふたりの身より流れいで</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-64375-64410"><seg source="#source-64375-64410">げにこがるれど慕へども</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-64410-64442"><seg source="#source-64410-64442">やむときもなき清十郎</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-64442-64469"><pb source="#source-64442-64463"/></p>
