      <div>
        <p source="#source-64594-64682"><seg source="#source-64594-64612">花によりそふ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-64612-64677"><rb><g ref="#gaiji-3-1-93-66" source="#source-64612-64659">雞</g></rb><rt>にはとり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-64677-64682">の</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-64682-64735"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-64682-64697"><rb>夫</rb><rt>つま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-64697-64700">よ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-64700-64721"><rb>妻鳥</rb><rt>めどり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-64721-64735">よ燕子花</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-64735-64773"><seg source="#source-64735-64773">いづれあやめとわきがたく</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-64773-64825"><seg source="#source-64773-64794">さも似つかしき</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-64794-64815"><rb>風情</rb><rt>ふぜい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-64815-64825">あり</seg></p>
