        <p source="#source-67057-67088"><seg source="#source-67057-67088">蹴爪に土をかき狂ふ</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-67088-67135"><seg source="#source-67088-67106">筆毛のさきも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-67106-67127"><rb>逆立</rb><rt>さかだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-67127-67135">ちて</seg></p>
