        <p source="#source-90433-90489"><seg source="#source-90433-90442">いかに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-90442-90460"><rb>萬</rb><rt>よろづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-90460-90463">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-90463-90481"><rb>恨</rb><rt>うらみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-90481-90489">をば</seg></p>
